    ns1:applicabilityCondition "For R1, inspect resource-linked descriptions of hypotheses, methods, assumptions, units, scope and limitations, and verify their accuracy and relevance for reuse. For R1.2, additionally inspect input versions, methods, agents and execution history. An unexplained model or hypothesis list is insufficient." ;
    ns1:derivedFromSourceNode <https://github.com/chris-day/FAIR-DAMA/blob/main/artefacts/dama-fair-mapping.ttl#contribution/BigDataDataScience/row-6/indirect/R1.2> ;
