    ns1:rationale """Identify Reference Data Sources and Contributors (P) [source: ReferenceMasterDataManagement!A3:F3] — Deliverable: Description and Assessment of Sources and Contributors.
Explicit partial support: descriptions of sources and contributors capture origin and responsibility relevant to provenance; association with specific data/metadata and transformation history are still needed. No implementation evidence is supplied.""" ;
    ns1:sourceCoordinate "ReferenceMasterDataManagement!A3:L3" ;
    ns1:sourceLayer "workbook_activity_table" ;
    ns1:targetsPrinciple <https://w3id.org/fair/principles/terms/R1.2> .

