    ns1:rationale """Process Data for Business Intelligence (O) [source: DWandBIActivities!A6:F6] — Deliverable: Accessible Integrated Data, Data Quality Feedback Details.
Inferred support: Accessible Integrated Data can be exposed for retrieval if identified resources are served through a standard protocol; the deliverable does not specify this mechanism. No implementation evidence is supplied.""" ;
