    ns1:sourcePosition 9 ;
    ns1:sourceText "Design Physical Databases (D) \\[source: DataDevelopment!A6:F6\\] — Deliverable: DDL Specifications, OLAP Cube Specs, XML schemas.; Inferred support: XML schemas can support formal machine-readable representation if the implemented language is shared, accessible and broadly applicable. DDL or OLAP specifications alone are not sufficient knowledge representation. No implementation evidence is supplied." .

