    ns1:fieldHeading "How they can support FAIR" ;
    ns1:sourcePosition 9 ;
    ns1:sourceText "Manage Users, Passwords and Group Membership (C) \\[source: DataSecurityManagement!A6:F6\\] — Deliverable: User Accounts, Passwords,Role Groups.; Inferred support: user accounts, passwords and role groups can supply authentication and authorisation when applied within a data/metadata retrieval protocol. Generic database security, credential management or access monitoring alone does not establish A1.2. No implementation evidence is supplied." .

