    ns1:sourcePosition 11 ;
    ns1:sourceText "A1.2: Test retrieval of identified data and metadata through the declared protocol with authorised, unauthorised and unauthenticated requests. Verify the documented authentication/authorisation procedure and expected decisions; unrestricted public access is not required.; Supporting-process evidence: inspect the named deliverable and its approval/maintenance records separately from the resource tests." .

