    ns1:fieldHeading "Indirect support" ;
    ns1:sourcePosition 10 ;
    ns1:sourceText "Indirect support: Records governance and lifecycle management can sustain content descriptions, controlled access and preservation commitments. Backups and archives are not proof of A2. Commission independent metadata retention and test access after content withdrawal." .

ns1:ACT-08-004-field-11 a owl:NamedIndividual,
        ns1:SourceField ;
    rdfs:label "What would demonstrate the supported FAIR requirement"@en ;
    dcterms:source <file:///D:/Work-Documents/13_Research/2026_Research/FAIR/research-repos/FAIR-DAMA-FAIRMM/sources/2026-11-16/DAMA_Segments_High_Level_v1.18.0.md#L1580> ;
    ns1:fieldHeading "What would demonstrate the supported FAIR requirement" ;
    ns1:sourcePosition 11 ;
    ns1:sourceText "Supporting-process evidence: inspect the named deliverable, responsible/approving roles and dated operating or review records for this activity. No directly supported FAIR requirement is established. To demonstrate FAIR fulfilment, separately test identified data and metadata against the specific requirements commissioned through this process. For an A2 extension, withdraw a sample data resource and verify that its retained metadata remain retrievable." .

