    ns1:fieldHeading "What would demonstrate the supported FAIR requirement" ;
    ns1:sourcePosition 11 ;
    ns1:sourceText "I2: Inspect the vocabulary term identifiers and versions actually used in data/metadata; assess the vocabulary itself for FAIR identifiers, discovery, access, representation, licensing and provenance. An internal glossary or taxonomy alone is insufficient.; Supporting-process evidence: inspect the named deliverable and its approval/maintenance records separately from the resource tests." .

