    ns1:fieldHeading "How they can support FAIR" ;
    ns1:sourcePosition 9 ;
    ns1:sourceText "Define and Maintain Enterprise Taxonomies (P)  \\[source: DocumentContentManagement!A7:F7\\] — Deliverable: Enterprise Taxonomies (Information Content Architecture).; Inferred support: enterprise taxonomies can supply controlled terms for content metadata; I2 additionally requires the vocabulary resources themselves to be FAIR. No implementation evidence is supplied." .

