    ns1:fieldHeading "What would demonstrate the supported FAIR requirement" ;
    ns1:sourcePosition 11 ;
    ns1:sourceText "F2: Inspect representative metadata linked to the described data; validate descriptive fields against a discovery profile covering meaning, scope, creator, temporal coverage and intended use as applicable. A requirements document or tool inventory alone is insufficient.; R1: Validate representative descriptions for multiple accurate and relevant attributes needed for reuse, including meaning, scope, creation context and limitations. Compare with authoritative sources; generic business-data quality is not evidence of rich descriptions.; Supporting-process evidence: inspect the named deliverable and its approval/maintenance records separately from the resource tests." .

