    ns1:sourceText "Integrate Metadata (C)  \\[source: MetadataManagement!A7:F7\\] — Deliverable: Integrated Metadata repositories.; Inferred support: integrated metadata repositories can exchange shared representations and qualified resource links; technical integration alone does not establish either requirement. No implementation evidence is supplied." .

