    ns1:fieldHeading "How they can support FAIR" ;
    ns1:sourcePosition 9 ;
    ns1:sourceText "Manage Metadata Repositories (C) \\[source: MetadataManagement!A8:F8\\] — Deliverable: Managed Metadata repositories ,; Administration, ; Principles, Practices, Tactics.; Inferred support: managed metadata repositories can register metadata in a searchable resource if indexing and query facilities are implemented; repository administration alone is insufficient. No implementation evidence is supplied." .

