    ns1:sourceText "There is a FAIR data strategy in place which accommodates both centralized enterprise-level FAIR data and federated domain-specific FAIR data, and there is an operating model, set of procedures, central models, and standards to harmonize, align, and connect functional domain data to expand and scale FAIR data beyond single or simple domain-specific use cases." ;
    ns1:supportedByDescriptor ns1:D3-L4 .

