    ns1:rationale "Define and Maintain Enterprise Ontologies, Taxonomies and Namespaces (P) \\[source: DataArchitectureManagement!A8:F8\\] — Deliverable: Enterprise Taxonomies, Industry Ontologies, ISO TC/68 alignment,  XML Namespaces,  Content Management Standards.; Inferred support: industry ontologies, taxonomies and XML namespaces can underpin formal representation and FAIR vocabulary use. ISO TC/68 alignment and content-management standards may support R1.3 where relevant to the domain community; no particular standard/version or conformance evidence is supplied. No implementation evidence is supplied." ;
    ns1:sourceCoordinate "DataArchitectureManagement!A8:L8" ;
    ns1:sourceLayer "activity_table" ;
    ns1:targetsPrinciple <https://w3id.org/fair/principles/terms/I1> .

