    ns1:rationale "Define Data Security Controls and Procedures (D) \\[source: DataSecurityManagement!A5:F5\\] — Deliverable: Data Security Controls and Procedures.; Inferred support: Data Security Controls and Procedures can define access checks when applied within a data/metadata retrieval protocol. Generic database security, credential management or access monitoring alone does not establish A1.2. No implementation evidence is supplied." ;
    ns1:sourceCoordinate "DataSecurityManagement!A5:L5" ;
    ns1:sourceLayer "activity_table" ;
    ns1:targetsPrinciple <https://w3id.org/fair/principles/terms/A1.2> .

