    ns1:rationale "Manage Data Access Views and Permissions (C) \\[source: DataSecurityManagement!A7:F7\\] — Deliverable: Data Access Views Data Resource Permissions.; Inferred support: resource permissions and access views can enforce authorisation when applied within a data/metadata retrieval protocol. Generic database security, credential management or access monitoring alone does not establish A1.2. No implementation evidence is supplied." ;
    ns1:sourceCoordinate "DataSecurityManagement!A7:L7" ;
    ns1:sourceLayer "activity_table" ;
    ns1:targetsPrinciple <https://w3id.org/fair/principles/terms/A1.2> .

