    ns1:rationale "Monitor User Authentication and Access Behavior (C) \\[source: DataSecurityManagement!A8:F8\\] — Deliverable: Data Access Logs, Security Notification Alerts, Data Security Reports.; Inferred support: authentication monitoring and access logs can verify access decisions when applied within a data/metadata retrieval protocol. Generic database security, credential management or access monitoring alone does not establish A1.2. No implementation evidence is supplied." ;
    ns1:sourceCoordinate "DataSecurityManagement!A8:L8" ;
    ns1:sourceLayer "activity_table" ;
