    ns1:rationale "Define and Maintain Hierarchies and Affiliations (C) \\[source: ReferenceMasterDataManagement!A8:F8\\] — Deliverable: Defined Hierarchies and Affiliations.; Inferred support: hierarchies and affiliations define relationship meanings which could be encoded as qualified resource references; internal entity structures alone are insufficient. No implementation evidence is supplied." ;
    ns1:sourceCoordinate "ReferenceMasterDataManagement!A8:L8" ;
    ns1:sourceLayer "activity_table" ;
    ns1:targetsPrinciple <https://w3id.org/fair/principles/terms/I3> .

