    ns1:rationale "Define and Maintain the Data Integration Architecture (P)  \\[source: DataArchitectureManagement!A6:F6\\] — Deliverable: Data Integration Architecture Data Lineage / Flows Entity Lifecycles.; Explicit partial support for R1.2: named Data Lineage/Flows and Entity Lifecycles can document origins and changes. Inferred support for I3: flows can be typed references between identifiable resources when implemented. No implementation evidence is supplied." ;
