    ns1:rationale "Design Data Access Services (D) \\[source: DataDevelopment!A8:F8\\] — Deliverable: Data Access Service Design Specifications.; Inferred support: access-service design can specify identifier-based retrieval through a standard protocol; neither identifiers nor protocols are named in the source. No implementation evidence is supplied." ;
