    ns1:rationale "Implement Document / Record Management Systems for Acquisition, Storage, Access, and Security Controls (O, C) \\[source: DocumentContentManagement!A3:F3\\] — Deliverable: Document / Record Management Systems (including image and e-mail systems), Portals,Paper and Electronic Documents (text, graphics, images, audio, video).; Inferred support: access and security controls in electronic document systems can implement identifier-based protocol retrieval and authorisation. Paper documents, storage or portals alone do not meet those requirements. No implementation evidence is supplied." ;
    ns1:sourceCoordinate "DocumentContentManagement!A3:L3" ;
    ns1:sourceLayer "activity_table" ;
    ns1:targetsPrinciple <https://w3id.org/fair/principles/terms/A1> .

